{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/6ywcuqg094ptkq9g5gk2js8dmyzlf7o.mp3","text":"在你离开之前，我负责你的护卫工作。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/fdgd4zoq8jr3y8yrbf0dneyqq0r9xfo.mp3","text":"博士，有没有那种快速增加身体携带电荷的方法。找会用电的干员？有道理，我去试试。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/95/ispzt7ao4mufr74cq7cq9q11l8jmavo.mp3","text":"矿石鉴别找莱恩哈特去，我不擅长这个。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/imiwbli887tbramg4ma9rzho5ejalja.mp3","text":"莱茵的大人物见我就拧着眉头，好像遇到什么害兽一样。我什么时候惹到她的，真是麻烦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/fvzm7d15osrpclxviu2kz7aelkij8c8.mp3","text":"耳朵竖起来了？没关系，嘶，只是被电得......有点舒服。一会，嘶，一会就会垂下去了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/67/6t3btws7n17bq99faxxgme4t65zq78r.mp3","text":"买这宝贝花了我两年的积蓄外加一笔借款。要不是它物超所值，黑市的卡特斯奸商早就把我丢矿船里运走了。能有今天的舒坦日子，全靠这会漏电的好家伙。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/3486hhp8jblh7cat0z7m6uwqx78rteq.mp3","text":"哦，你在啊，新鲜冰镇盐渍毛豆，来一根？不用？你要学会理解这种食物，拿着，吃。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/70/tuwy98mxme93tygeww4jgjbfe8sjgrj.mp3","text":"莱恩哈特太吵了，事又多，还是你这里消停。什么？他和医疗部的人开玩笑被围住了？掌握不好分寸会要人命，他就是学不会，啧。我去圆个场，博士你方便一起来吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/rh9g6xoa1hvfqfba3kusyosx7mhv3nf.mp3","text":"我保护莱特，只是因为我们从小就是这样过来的。他出事，我摆平，反之也一样，但我和你可没那么长久稳定的关系，别以为帮我贴创可贴就能套近乎，明白了吗。上次我也是这么说的？啧，完了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/adlz3hpbrh0u4d90z5fwnhz971aat79.mp3","text":"嗯？！嗯......是你啊。没什么，我就躺会回回力气。你要想在这休息，我把位置让给你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/bmeobzyxeokozdjkm32l75rr4w4tz7q.mp3","text":"天灾信使护卫，断崖。 合作愉快。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/eygyrt1wg1wgyrcn58ourgvff6ntnsf.mp3","text":"很专业，值得学习。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/lriwwhidcrx3sw2xcb3lgux60k1bhje.mp3","text":"最近的薪水是不是给多了？升职？啊，好的，谢谢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/oixpeax0nvyohr2lkoy7guw5hb9zfsj.mp3","text":"护卫不是防御，是掌控。掌控保护者周边的空间，扫除一切威胁。我证明给你看，如何？","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/ldhdcs84n37gu3c7muq4gts0festjfl.mp3","text":"入队，等待部署任务。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/0tskdu6ae90k126byccl4ivo4q13j9d.mp3","text":"按照自己的节奏行动起来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/a23ue0y650pvkgi0va25ep6ebpkx9gs.mp3","text":"周围没有异动，小队可以出发。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/c7f8nbhu8w23fav7hq4v7cx70dx8a6e.mp3","text":"发现目标，上了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/cmey5dwvovz4csyhn7toc3tu683h1rz.mp3","text":"啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/8i5mu276rhut94xgwm4os7f9ujwydet.mp3","text":"等你命令。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:6/62/imu7iaz0pvitsrlms33bwniiadpc2dp.mp3","text":"装置，启动。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/nlh3xcfd85so6s4pxshdfzvnqzoah6m.mp3","text":"干活了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/rsocpjc2yaw911sx3erwgwx8dj4q2vp.mp3","text":"晚了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/78/m10dcinr7fzr67a7lndkehzyzt65r0f.mp3","text":"拿你性命！","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/35/2f16onhw9sixnjmfj3yx4cku1ygca9u.mp3","text":"进攻就是最好的护卫。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/59/nxzypq7yxlrf9g0dc3m838o931tda81.mp3","text":"只有生死，无关胜负。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/35du4oh5pwbrzno18xha56biixhc27d.mp3","text":"一切都掌握得不错，哼，恭喜。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/l3yd87070tbqij18eqpplf6j6szkb9k.mp3","text":"时间正好，该走了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/a2htk6hnxba63xec53vdxfd0oya53vh.mp3","text":"脱离的人在你计划之内，我可以这么认为吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_294_ayer/cn_03